'''Cookieblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Cookieblade Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux during Part 1 of the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a flare shaped blade that is made out of a chocolate cookie with small multicolored sprinkles all over it, hence the name. Surrounding the blade is the white edge made out of frosting with three small semi circle shaped indents on each side. The red guard with curved quillons that is partially clipped to the ricasso of the blade is held together by an orange pentagon. The handle, connected to the orange pentagon, is green in color with a half orange and half red oval shaped pommel attached to the bottom of it.

== Trivia ==
* This and [[Peppermint]] replaced [[Prismatic]] in the [[shop]].
*It was released after [[Peppermint]] during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

